# s3: bootstrap change while idle, then recreation on the next arrival   (UTC 2026-09-17)

## Run 1, to put a session on the old daemon

$ docs/qa/ac-50k/run.sh qa-s3-run-1
fire 13:28:39.819   triggerRunId 9c13d906
13:28:40.135 daemon a86478c3 offline (disconnected 13:27:35.771) — the sprite had paused
13:28:41.271 daemon a86478c3 connected 13:28:40.751 ; exec 66fd4c91 spawning on a86478c3
             session b4172226 key custom:qa-ac50k daemon a86478c3 agent -
13:28:41.844 exec 66fd4c91 action=created ; session b4172226 agent dbbf5c26
13:28:42.416 exec 66fd4c91 running
13:30:42.928 exec 66fd4c91 failed  {"reason":"step_idle_timeout"}   run failed step_idle_timeout
Terminal is step_idle_timeout because this environment has no Claude credential. An agent was created,
so the session is a real one with an agent id.

