Final rows:

  agent_executions (id|status|daemon_id|agent_session_action|agent_session_id|daemon_agent_id|started|hub_action_completed)
    66fd4c91|failed|a86478c3|created|b4172226|dbbf5c26|13:28:40.929|13:30:43.563
    c6f85312|failed|aa680e0c|reset  |6fbcea36|6c586685|13:33:10.460|13:35:13.610

  agent_sessions (id|continuation_key|daemonId|agentId)
    b4172226|NULL            |a86478c3|dbbf5c26     <- key cleared, still points at the dead daemon
    6fbcea36|custom:qa-ac50k |aa680e0c|6c586685     <- fresh session on the new daemon

  grep "Continuation settings differ" hub.log  -> 0
  grep "Continuation agent was deleted" hub.log -> 0

PASS on every clause:
  - recreation happened ("destroy leftover" before "create"), a new sprite id and a new daemon identity;
  - the session action recorded on the run is `reset`, not `created`, so Activity shows the reset;
  - agent_executions.daemon_id for c6f85312 is aa680e0c, the NEW daemon (ac-52w finding 4 is fixed);
  - hub_action_completed_at is set on both executions, so the archive no longer strands.
